  "jcr:description": "The IP00C335 from i-Chips is a multi-functional image processing LSI that integrates scaling, de-interlacing, and multi-window video processing with embedded frame memory. It is designed to process up to four independent 4K60 video streams in real time, enabling compact system architectures for advanced display, broadcast, and ProAV applications. ",
